@startuml
title Firmware RPC layers on the MCU

rectangle "driver UART / USB" as Driver
rectangle "transport layer" as Transport
rectangle "framing layer" as Framing
rectangle "serialization layer" as Serialization
rectangle "RPC dispatcher" as Dispatcher
rectangle "application handlers" as Handlers
rectangle "hardware abstraction layer" as Hal

Driver -down-> Transport
Transport -down-> Framing
Framing -down-> Serialization
Serialization -down-> Dispatcher
Dispatcher -down-> Handlers
Handlers -down-> Hal

@enduml
